From 8162103f6a8d2ca4c26f127f0d4dc9207909705c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mich-murphy <github@elmurphy.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:28:17 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(theme): a border role for tables, unfocused note bubbles
 and the tree divider

Table borders came from tui-markdown's default dark gray, and the unfocused note bubbles and file-tree divider hardcoded the same colour, so no [colors] key could reach them. [colors] border now sets all three; the default stays dark gray, so nothing changes unless it is set.
